% expect-output: Times-Italic
% expect-output: Courier
% expect-output: Helvetica-Bold
% expect-output: Symbol
% Scenario: style heuristic. A name outside the alias table is classed by
% hints in it (serif, monospace, symbol) and styled by weight and slope
% hints; a subset tag is ignored; the default is Helvetica.
% Expect: Times-Italic, Courier, Helvetica-Bold, Symbol.
/Garamond-Italic findfont /FontName get =
/LucidaConsole findfont /FontName get =
/ABCDEF+Verdana-Bold findfont /FontName get =
/SymbolMT findfont /FontName get =
